WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.225
The Long-Term Cost.

00:00:02.175 --> 00:00:06.237
Pandemic spending did not end when programs wound down.

00:00:06.237 --> 00:00:12.312
The PBO documents a debt burden that will constrain federal fiscal capacity for a generation.

00:00:12.312 --> 00:00:21.050
Interest on pandemic debt is now a permanent line item in the budget — money servicing past borrowing instead of funding current programs.
